---
description: Agency SEO Ranker — 29-point audit checklist for AI-built websites
alwaysApply: true
---

At the start of any website-audit task, follow the `agency-seo-ranker` skill
(`SKILL.md` in the same repo). Run the 29-item checklist across 7 phases
in order — crawlability first, competition last. Score each item 0–3
(out of 87 total). Return a scorecard table, prioritized fix list, and a
30-day improvement plan. Read SKILL.md once per chat, not on every turn.
